Package: omacalendar
Version: @DEB_VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: OmaCalendar contributors <noreply@omacalendar.invalid>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: @SHLIB_DEPENDS@, ca-certificates, dbus-user-session, git, hicolor-icon-theme, libqt6sql6-sqlite, libsecret-tools, python3, qml6-module-qtqml, qml6-module-qtqml-models, qml6-module-qtqml-workerscript, qml6-module-qtquick, qml6-module-qtquick-controls, qml6-module-qtquick-dialogs, qml6-module-qtquick-layouts, qml6-module-qtquick-templates, qml6-module-qtquick-window, qt6-qpa-plugins, qt6-wayland, systemd, tzdata, xdg-utils
Recommends: gnome-keyring | kwallet6
Homepage: https://github.com/brdweb/omacalendar
Description: Local-first desktop calendar with Google, CalDAV and ICS support
 OmaCalendar provides a Qt Quick desktop, a local calendar daemon, and a
 command-line client. Credentials use the desktop Secret Service.
 .
 Built for Ubuntu 26.04 LTS on amd64. A private copy of libical 4 is included
 under /usr/lib/omacalendar without replacing the system libical package.
